        <core:definition>A diet that contains limited amounts of CARBOHYDRATES. This is in distinction to a regular DIET. (MSH)</core:definition>
        <core:definition>Decrease in carbohydrate content of the diet compared to the assessed baseline intake of carbohydrate for the individual. (SNOMEDCT_US)</core:definition>
