 https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C1831689</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Gonzalez_Regimen</rdfs:label>
        <core:definition>An alternative therapy that is being studied as a treatment for pancreatic cancer. It includes a special diet, nutritional supplements, pancreatic enzymes, and coffee enemas. (NCI)</core:definition>
