 https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C0031765</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Phototherapy</rdfs:label>
        <core:altLabel>Light Therapy</core:altLabel>
        <core:altLabel>Light Treatment</core:altLabel>
        <core:altLabel>Photomedicine</core:altLabel>
        <core:altLabel>Photophoresis</core:altLabel>
        <core:definition>The treatment of a disorder by exposure to light, including ultraviolet and infrared radiation. (Bartleby.com) (NCI)</core:definition>
        <core:definition>Treatment of disease by exposure to light, especially by variously concentrated light rays or specific wavelengths. (MSH)</core:definition>
        <core:definition>treatment of a disease by exposure to light, especially by variously concentrated light rays or specific wavelengths. (CSP)</core:definition>
        <UMLS_CUI>C0031765</UMLS_CUI>
        <UMLS_Semantic_Type>Therapeutic or Preventive Procedure</UMLS_Semantic_Type>
    </owl:Class>
    


