        <core:definition>[Source: National Center for Complementary and Integrative Health (NCCIH)] Cat’s claw is a woody vine that grows wild in the Amazon rainforest and other tropical areas of Central and South America.</core:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://github.com/Tao-AI-group/COMBINI#000585 -->

